  "_comment": "Lists of addresses that change too often for the twice-daily .aupldb build. Every WAF node fetches these itself, from the publisher, on each source's own cadence (aupldb.Overlay). Curated from OpenASN's fetch-manifest.json (https://github.com/openasn/openasn), 28 Oct 2026; each URL verified live that day. Parsers: lines (first field per line is an IP or prefix), geofeed (RFC 8805 CSV: prefix,country,...), json (string values, or arrays of them, under the listed keys), regex (first capture group). Clients skip parsers and classes they don't know.",
